// sha2.tri: SHA-256 and SHA-512 (FIPS 180-4) on octets (one per tryte).
//
// SHA-256 works on 32-bit values (bin32.tri). SHA-512's 64-bit values
// do not fit a 27-trit word, so each is a pair of 32-bit halves.

